{"kind":"stack","id":"gravity-stack","title":"Gravity: why things fall","theme":{"background":"#f4f8ff","foreground":"#1d2b3a","font":"Trebuchet MS, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Gravity"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"Gravity is a pull between the Earth and every object. It pulls unsupported objects down towards the Earth."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"When you drop a pencil, what pulls it down?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"Gravity","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Wind","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"Magnetism","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which way does gravity pull a falling apple?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Towards the Earth","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Up into the sky","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Sideways","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"You are on a hill and you let go of a ball. Do you run after it or wait at the top?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Run after it","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Wait at the top","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"You run down the hill. The ball rolled down too, pulled by gravity. You catch it at the bottom."},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You wait. The ball rolls down the hill by itself, pulled by gravity, and stops at the bottom."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"What does gravity do to a ball you let go of on a hill?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Pulls it down the hill","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Pushes it up the hill","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-c","label":"Leaves it floating","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"Unsupported"},{"type":"text","id":"c8-e","content":"Unsupported means nothing is holding the object up, so it is free to fall."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"A book sits on a table. What stops it falling?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"The table supports it","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Gravity is switched off","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"The book is too light to fall","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Which pulls harder on an object, the Earth or the object?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"The Earth pulls harder","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"The object pulls harder","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"They pull equally hard","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-t","content":"You finished the gravity lesson!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Well done. Gravity pulls every unsupported object towards the Earth. Keep asking why things fall."}],"actions":[]}}
